{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e70c303554e315210f3d06852e2022ac6f6fa1493ea4a08a4a74127091664bb2","ja":"迷子アプリ、ゲーム開始","zh":"迷路应用，游戏开始","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f5ad6fcd7a727d9a546582c65925b259acb90a4f77120dd14317c803d736f36e","ja":"迷子アプリで亜美を見つけるのか……。なんか、\nゲームみたいで面白そうだな！　受けて立とうぜ！","zh":"用防走失软件找到亚美吗……感觉像\n做游戏一样挺有意思的嘛！放马过来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"92e745bd392b486b1f55df97f01e8c3d9b1be8b68969339978eddd4234cb8c4e","ja":"迷子アプリは入れたままだし。\nほら、京都観光のときに、志保が教えてくれたヤツ！","zh":"防走丢App也还装着呢。\n你看，就是去京都观光的时候，志保告诉我的那个！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ad800740cb24fd14572120f96fa7825c992db0afa41f4f2fb4ede0b64dc24ccf","ja":"ですが、こんなに人が多いと、位置情報だけで\n見つけて捕まえられるか不安ですね……。","zh":"但是，人有这么多的情况下，单凭位置信息\n能不能找到并抓住目标，真让人有些不安呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"bcb83d43f9f07e01bce234061ebec233efa3e5fa1f0bf8abbd32f7a06e914445","ja":"志保さんの集中力と、昴さんの素早い動きがあれば、\nきっと大丈夫です！","zh":"只要有志保的专注力和昂敏捷的身手，\n就一定没问题的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"605219229c0196e92e7159cefe20c79e17ccba7c9b93e0712f9a1c8505a4f92d","ja":"微力ながら、私も頑張りますから！","zh":"虽然力量微薄，但我也会加油的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f699dd8e406e2a0971961674cbfc56bc03872f9b2364ad9d8fbafa6d49551608","ja":"そうね……わかったわ。\nレッスンも控えてるし、早く見つけましょう。","zh":"也是呢……我知道了。\n之后还要上课，快点找出来吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fe41158b56a8997ac5388a0eb1238d35ba2874582c7c4f3e12e7fa00750bdb09","ja":"決まりだな！\nじゃあ、亜美の居場所を調べよーぜ！","zh":"决定了！\n那就来调查一下亚美在哪吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329","ja":"数分後……","zh":"过了几分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"de670af55bb5c512a0aa262876cd876e8941937bdd0406f1082acc27a91e490c","ja":"ピコン、ピコン、ピコン！","zh":"哔咚、哔咚、哔咚！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"f1ee949250144e36115eac33b838df6ca62de210fabd747a52d2d01e11a7e47c","ja":"あっ、接近アラームの音！？\n亜美、このあたりにいるんじゃないか？","zh":"啊，是接近警报的声音！？\n亚美是不是就在这附近？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1ecda069f7ed2495fae141002e77155b0f9e7ac5a0d5f9f789bacf90aada053b","ja":"そうですね、でも見あたらな……あっ！\nアラーム音が消えた……。","zh":"也是呢，但没找……啊！\n闹钟声停了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"437b4375797cc288ed1d9885f8fa8585ee494b0f9148ea208bdcdfcafe6b8882","ja":"もしかして、位置情報をオフにしたのかも？\nそれですぐ、ここから移動した……？","zh":"难道把定位功能关掉了？\n然后马上从这里离开了……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f0ff15c6ba02148fa124712afe17aaf3b2b7c275314dce21a3e9aee44e69ef23","ja":"Wow！　さすが亜美さんです。\nまるで忍者のような俊敏さ……！","zh":"Wow！真不愧是亚美小姐。\n简直就像忍者一样敏捷……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"64980dbe6b83ec91badbeb8a46a0b0a49c4850557f347a688c2cb101050ddd56","ja":"……まさか、こんな使い方してくるなんて。","zh":"……真没想到，居然会用这种方式。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"cbf1fcad6253948bcd9787182f70829cc212ffe4e1ed14cb50b5a84183613a3e","ja":"甘く考えてたわ。\nもっと、本気で探さないと……！","zh":"是我把事情想得太简单了。\n必须更认真地寻找才行……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1072.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"fc88d35c3d1d33d44d39d538300fa57ecc2700eb2be6a18fc8f84d02e2f8157e","ja":"ああ！　亜美に負けないように、\n急いで移動しようぜ！","zh":"啊！为了不输给亚美，\n咱们也赶快过去吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
